    "metaDescription": "Whale shark snorkeling hurghada picks for 2026: which trips raise your odds, which to skip, and the season window that actually matters.",
    "publishedAt": "2026-08-23T20:45:57.384Z",
    "heroImage": "/images/ryze-blog/whale-shark-snorkeling-excursions-in-hurghada.jpg",
